# Event$ Transform | ValidCard$ Card.Self | ReplaceWith$ DBChoose on the back
# face (DB$ ChoosePlayer | Choices$ Player.Opponent). Zenos enters and chooses
# the opponent's Grizzly Bears; a Lightning Bolt kills the Bears, "when the
# chosen creature leaves the battlefield, transform Zenos" fires, and Card.
# changeCardState runs the replacement once Zenos is Shinryu: human chooses ai.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
tapformana human 5 B
tapformana human 6 B
tapformana human 7 B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue cardchoice 9
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 8 R
queue targets 9
queue playerchoice ai
castspell human 2
resolvestack
